      "after": "AUTHOR CANDIDATE ONLY: bounded human-authorized repair of the actual old first-visual-FAIL. Context: /Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3695/lemmadeck/.tmp/resume182-6-8a-n8-fig16-author3695-FIRST/context.json; SHA-256 d9d2b7c80aab09243bb8e0671e10ea2419b16adc185b4365e5b6c51924880ea9. Independent source inventory was sealed after one original PNG view and before the old package was read. Preserve all old geometry/assertion values, the 38 by 27 grid, finite circle/line, A(-8,6), B(6,-8), and B label offset 60. Hide the seven unprinted construction anchors using existing visible:false; O is a separate text label at the unchanged origin/label offset. Only y and y-unit receive fixed left clearance. Exact lattice/circle/extrema/terminals, semantic colors, enlarged upright equation text and A/B point emphasis are modern regularization/additions, not extra source point glyphs. No candidate image has been opened, no visual or full-task math approval is claimed, and no promotion or publishing is authorized. One new content repair; the old ordinary repair budget is 0/exhausted and is not reset."
